mber\":1,\"name\":\"Going Bodmin\",\"overview\":\"After developing a sudden fear of blood, successful surgeon Dr. Martin Ellingham abandons London for a general practice in a quiet Cornish hamlet.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eLxCeu8M5DbkOw3Gr59eb43XhWZ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-02\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Gentlemen Prefer\",\"overview\":\"Quirky Doc Martin opens his village practice, only to discover that most of his 'patients' enjoy using his waiting room as a makeshift social club.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2g7kNLqUuW7DeSo9D39eJmXCGl4.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-09\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Sh*t Happens\",\"overview\":\"When a nasty stomach virus hits Portwenn, half the village takes ill, and Doc thinks he has traced the virus's source to the local swimming pool.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cxJE8GDju3e34BMIoml9f6tPcSL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-16\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Portwenn Effect\",\"overview\":\"After turning down lovely teacher Louisa's invitation to a village dance, the socially awkward Doc treats a park ranger with an unusual problem.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2lg3Vq1CFzdUqsahmw95z8F7RCZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-23\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Of All the Harbours in All the Towns\",\"overview\":\"When one of his Aunt Joan's former beaus comes back to Portwenn to woo her, Doc must butt in after discovering the man has a serious heart condition.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lGq94HrvsFvjsqk9w1bG5jqWAcY.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2004-09-30\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Haemophobia\",\"overview\":\"Upon discovering Doc's fear of blood, the village starts buzzing with the news. Bert insists on playing a practical joke, but Doc isn't laughing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/85ZTfvyclCATWCM2J0GmeYlP0sn.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2004-10-07\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2004-09-02\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}